{"id":"cf9397afecc15874","group":"16","path":"16/16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension.md","title":"纤维闭性不足以给出闭理解","display":"ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension — 纤维闭性不足以给出闭理解","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension","display":"ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension — 纤维闭性不足以给出闭理解","depends_on":["[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-cleavage]]"],"source":"Explicit counterexample; Definitions 10.4.2 and 10.5.3","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension","16-ex--fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension — 纤维闭性不足以给出闭理解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Explicit counterexample; Definitions 10.4.2 and 10.5.3"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension</span><span>16-ex--fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 是自然数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n\">\\(X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n\\)</span> 表示集合与有限序数之间的双射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin}\">\\(O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin}\\)</span> 及六个范畴结构分量在下文构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in O_{\\rm fin}\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in Z^Y\">\\(g\\in Z^Y\\)</span> 是函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_X\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_X\\)</span> 是恒等函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathbf1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 与提升族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 均由下节的集合记录定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1^{\\to}\">\\(\\mathbf1^{\\to}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a> 的箭头范畴构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cloven}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4ea27d39c2af987b\" href=\"?note=4ea27d39c2af987b\" title=\"16-df-cleavage\">16-df-cleavage</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\)</span> 中的重索引取同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3015a5a145e2e498\" href=\"?note=3015a5a145e2e498\" title=\"16-df-closed-comprehension\">16-df-closed-comprehension</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\rm fin}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathcal U\\mid(\\exists n\\in\\omega)(\\exists b:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n)\\ b=b\\},\\\\\nM_{\\rm fin}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y,f)\\mid X,Y\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\land f\\in Y^X\\},\\\\\ns_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\\qquad t_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)\\coloneqq Y,\\\\\ne_{\\rm fin}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X,\\operatorname{id}_X),\\\\\nc_{\\rm fin}((Y,Z,g),(X,Y,f))&amp;\\coloneqq(X,Z,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin},s_{\\rm fin},t_{\\rm fin},e_{\\rm fin},c_{\\rm fin}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U},\\qquad\\mathbf{FinSet}\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\rm fin}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathcal U\\mid(\\exists n\\in\\omega)(\\exists b:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n)\\ b=b\\},\\\\\nM_{\\rm fin}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y,f)\\mid X,Y\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\land f\\in Y^X\\},\\\\\ns_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)&amp;\\coloneqq X,\\qquad t_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)\\coloneqq Y,\\\\\ne_{\\rm fin}(X)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,X,\\operatorname{id}_X),\\\\\nc_{\\rm fin}((Y,Z,g),(X,Y,f))&amp;\\coloneqq(X,Z,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin},s_{\\rm fin},t_{\\rm fin},e_{\\rm fin},c_{\\rm fin}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U},\\qquad\\mathbf{FinSet}\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n*&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\iota\\coloneqq\\langle*,*,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\\\\nO_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{*\\},\\qquad M_1\\coloneqq\\{\\iota\\},\\\\\ns_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota,*)\\},\\qquad t_1\\coloneqq s_1,\\\\\ne_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(*,\\iota)\\},\\qquad c_1\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,\\iota),\\iota)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_1,M_1,s_1,t_1,e_1,c_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\zeta&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota,\\iota,\\iota,\\iota\\rangle,\\\\\np_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,*)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\np_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\iota)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\chi_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,\\iota)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\zeta)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\chi_0,\\chi_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,X),e_{\\rm fin}(X))\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\chi,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B^{\\to}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n*&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\iota\\coloneqq\\langle*,*,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\\\\nO_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{*\\},\\qquad M_1\\coloneqq\\{\\iota\\},\\\\\ns_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota,*)\\},\\qquad t_1\\coloneqq s_1,\\\\\ne_1&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(*,\\iota)\\},\\qquad c_1\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,\\iota),\\iota)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_1,M_1,s_1,t_1,e_1,c_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\zeta&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota,\\iota,\\iota,\\iota\\rangle,\\\\\np_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,*)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\np_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\iota)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\chi_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,\\iota)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\zeta)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\chi_0,\\chi_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,X),e_{\\rm fin}(X))\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\chi,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B^{\\to}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：沿基恒等箭头可取恒等提升，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 将任何笛卡尔箭头送到唯一的拉回方块，故有理解结构。</li>\n<li>唯一纤维是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}\">\\(\\mathbf{FinSet}\\)</span>，终对象、积和函数集合都有限，因而 CCC；唯一重索引为恒等，故纤维 CCC。</li>\n<li>有限集合范畴、终范畴及两个函子的对象/箭头作用在前两节已给出完整记录；这里的反例不依赖未编码的常值函子或仅以名称引用的具体范畴。</li>\n<li>但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FinSet}(1,2)\">\\(\\mathbf{FinSet}(1,2)\\)</span> 有两个元素，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1^{\\to}(\\chi1,\\chi2)\">\\(\\mathbf1^{\\to}(\\chi1,\\chi2)\\)</span> 只有一个，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 不忠实。因此未满足闭理解必需的满忠实条件。</li>\n<li>该反例保留“理解范畴”前提，直接反驳原文件对一般理解结构的等价。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Explicit counterexample; Definitions 10.4.2 and 10.5.3。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-closed-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"3015a5a145e2e498","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-closed-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cleavage","status":"resolved","id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cleavage]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-set]] 的 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$\\omega$ 是自然数集合，$X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n$ 表示集合与有限序数之间的双射。$O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin}$ 及六个范畴结构分量在下文构造；$X,Y,Z\\in O_{\\rm fin}$，$f\\in Y^X$、$g\\in Z^Y$ 是函数图，$\\operatorname{id}_X$ 是恒等函数图。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hy