d-comprehension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompCat}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-comprehension-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n","display":false},{"tex":"O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z\\in O_{\\rm fin}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in Z^Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1^{\\to}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\rm fin}&\\coloneqq\\{X\\in\\mathcal U\\mid(\\exists n\\in\\omega)(\\exists b:X\\xrightarrow{\\sim}n)\\ b=b\\},\\\\\nM_{\\rm fin}&\\coloneqq\\{(X,Y,f)\\mid X,Y\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\land f\\in Y^X\\},\\\\\ns_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)&\\coloneqq X,\\qquad t_{\\rm fin}(X,Y,f)\\coloneqq Y,\\\\\ne_{\\rm fin}(X)&\\coloneqq(X,X,\\operatorname{id}_X),\\\\\nc_{\\rm fin}((Y,Z,g),(X,Y,f))&\\coloneqq(X,Z,g\\circ f),\\\\\n\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}&\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\rm fin},M_{\\rm fin},s_{\\rm fin},t_{\\rm fin},e_{\\rm fin},c_{\\rm fin}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal E&\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U},\\qquad\\mathbf{FinSet}\\coloneqq\\mathbf{FinSet}_{\\mathcal U}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n*&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\iota\\coloneqq\\langle*,*,\\varnothing\\rangle,\\\\\nO_1&\\coloneqq\\{*\\},\\qquad M_1\\coloneqq\\{\\iota\\},\\\\\ns_1&\\coloneqq\\{(\\iota,*)\\},\\qquad t_1\\coloneqq s_1,\\\\\ne_1&\\coloneqq\\{(*,\\iota)\\},\\qquad c_1\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,\\iota),\\iota)\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1&\\coloneqq\\langle O_1,M_1,s_1,t_1,e_1,c_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathcal B\\coloneqq\\mathbf1,\\\\\n\\zeta&\\coloneqq\\langle\\iota,\\iota,\\iota,\\iota\\rangle,\\\\\np_0&\\coloneqq\\{(X,*)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\np_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\iota)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\chi_0&\\coloneqq\\{(X,\\iota)\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\qquad\n\\chi_1\\coloneqq\\{(a,\\zeta)\\mid a\\in M_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\np&\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\qquad\\chi\\coloneqq\\langle\\chi_0,\\chi_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\kappa&\\coloneqq\\{((\\iota,X),e_{\\rm fin}(X))\\mid X\\in O_{\\rm fin}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal E)&\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(\\chi,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B^{\\to}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi).","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FinSet}(1,2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1^{\\to}(\\chi1,\\chi2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false}],"bytes":4349,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension|ex-fibred-ccc-not-closed-comprehension — 纤维闭性不足以给出闭理解]]"}],"outgoing":["0ba8f021ca287877",